ded to give it a try the other day and I'm glad I did. The server was very helpful with letting me customize my order the way I like (no rice/noodles w/ extra veggies instead) and the food was pretty good. With it being just a short walk from home I'll most certainly return the next time I'm in the mood for some Thai food!"},{"business_id":"iC12uB5WlrarJg55hVqieg","review_id":"eUCSLa8fGYGJrmk_BHBKuQ","date":"2016-08-13T19:20:04","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9321211576461792,"text_excerpt":"Went here about 45 minutes before closing on Thursday night and was surprised at how busy it was. Sat at the bar and was promptly greeted. Very good Thai food (I had the Mint Garlic Basil Chicken) and I'll definitely be coming back."},{"business_id":"iC12uB5WlrarJg55hVqieg","review_id":"4CkubCVu68_CG-05FdN0Dg","date":"2019-10-10T17:56:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9304238557815552,"text_excerpt":"Came here for lunch today and overall really good experience. My friend and I both ordered pad thai, and the portion was extremely generous for 9.95. I didn't notice that it had shrimp in addition to the chicken- probably listed on the menu and I missed it - easy enough to pick out, but if it matters to you, they are the non-deveined kind of shrimp. As others have described, service is just okay. We were never offered water refills even though both glasses were empty. However the service was prompt and the food came out quickly. A decent lunch spot in the area if you're craving Thai food."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"iC12uB5WlrarJg55hVqieg","photo_id":"xyxRQO3R4nKKUsNIx5RKzQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/xyxRQO3R4nKKUsNIx5RKzQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
